  <header>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">Error XS9247</para>
  </header>
  <para styleclass="Normal">foreach statement cannot operate on enumerators of type '{0}' because it is a type parameter that allows ref struct and it is not known at compile time to implement IDisposable.</para>
  <para styleclass="Normal"></para>
